WEBVTT

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.782
you can see that there are
dramatic changes that occur

00:07:01.806 --> 00:07:03.608
when the tumor is being starved.

00:07:04.703 --> 00:07:06.607
Here's a woman with a breast cancer,

00:07:06.631 --> 00:07:09.555
being treated with the antiangiogenic
drug called Avastin,

00:07:09.579 --> 00:07:11.547
which is FDA approved.

00:07:11.571 --> 00:07:14.264
And you can see
that the halo of blood flow

00:07:14.288 --> 00:07:16.273
disappears after treatment.

00:07:17.463 --> 00:07:20.976
Well, I've just shown you
two very different types of cancer

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.769
that both responded
to antiangiogenic therapy.

00:07:24.166 --> 00:07:26.325
So a few years ago, I asked myself,

00:07:26.349 --> 00:07:30.285
"Can we take this one step further
and treat other cancers,